        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>报警安全教育表</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      background: #deded9;\n      color: #171717;\n      font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 29px 37px 10px 40px;\n      background: #e5e5e0;\n    }\n\n    table {\n      width: 460px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      border: 1px solid #555;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.78;\n    }\n\n    col.number-column {\n      width: 47px;\n    }\n\n    col.content-column {\n      width: 413px;\n    }\n\n    th,\n    td {\n      border: 1px solid #696969;\n      vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    thead th {\n      height: 27px;\n      padding: 1px 5px;\n      text-align: left;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 23px;\n    }\n\n    thead th:first-child {\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    td.number {\n      padding: 3px 3px 1px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    td.content {\n      padding: 3px 5px 2px;\n      text-align: left;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n\n    tr.row-50 td { height: 56px; }\n    tr.row-51 td { height: 53px; }\n    tr.row-52 td { height: 76px; }\n    tr.row-53 td { height: 54px; }\n    tr.row-54 td { height: 54px; }\n    tr.row-55 td { height: 54px; }\n    tr.row-56 td { height: 53px; }\n    tr.row-57 td { height: 32px; }\n    tr.row-58 td { height: 32px; }\n    tr.row-59 td { height: 32px; }\n    tr.row-60 td { height: 31px; }\n    tr.row-61 td { height: 31px; }\n    tr.row-62 td { height: 31px; }\n    tr.row-63 td { height: 32px; }\n    tr.row-64 td { height: 31px; }\n\n    @media (max-width: 540px) {\n      .page {\n        width: 100%;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n        padding-left: 7.4vw;\n        padding-right: 6.8vw;\n      }\n\n      table {\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n\n      col.number-column {\n        width: 10.2%;\n      }\n\n      col.content-column {\n        width: 89.8%;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <table aria-label=\"报警安全教育表\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"number-column\">\n        <col class=\"content-column\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th></th>\n          <th>报警</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"row-50\">\n          <td class=\"number\">50</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">下午放学后，教育幼儿要拉着大人走，不能自己到处跑，不能停留在幼儿园玩耍，以防意外。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-51\">\n          <td class=\"number\">51</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿知道自己的姓名、园名、家长姓名、单位、家庭住址、电话，会表达清楚；紧急情况知道如何保护自己</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-52\">\n          <td class=\"number\">52</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿不随意轻信生人的话，未经允许不跟陌生人走，更不要让陌生人碰自己的身体，告诉孩子，只有家长、医生、护士才能触摸他(她)的身体，如果陌生人要这么做，一定要尽快逃开。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-53\">\n          <td class=\"number\">53</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿在家不自己动手反锁门，不玩煤气、炉火、火机、开水壶、饮水机、药品等危险物品。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-54\">\n          <td class=\"number\">54</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿没成人带领下不能自己过马路，过马路时，应遵守交通规则，走人行道，不在马路上停留和玩耍，上街走路靠右边走。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-55\">\n          <td class=\"number\">55</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">教育孩子单独在家时，不随意开门，听到敲门声不要开门，可说：“我父母不在家，请你以后再来”，以防窃贼趁大人不在时闯入盗窃。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-56\">\n          <td class=\"number\">56</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">到野外旅行或散步时不得随便采摘花果、抓捕昆虫，更不应该放入口内。以防意外。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-57\">\n          <td class=\"number\">57</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">上放学时注意交通安全，慢行;一看、二望、三听令。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-58\">\n          <td class=\"number\">58</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">骑车学生注意不与机动车辆抢道，走人行横道，靠路右边走;</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-59\">\n          <td class=\"number\">59</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">注意道路和车辆信号，服从交通管理</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-60\">\n          <td class=\"number\">60</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">不穿越、攀登、跨越道路隔离栏</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-61\">\n          <td class=\"number\">61</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">不乘坐“三无”车辆，即不乘坐无车牌、无行驶证、无养路费行驶的机动车辆。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-62\">\n          <td class=\"number\">62</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">不拾捡不明食物进食;</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-63\">\n          <td class=\"number\">63</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">注意传染源，发现病人及时治疗，与病人密切接触的要检查。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"row-64\">\n          <td class=\"number\">64</td>\n          <td class=\"content\">饭前便后要洗手</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
